        "text": "On Training Days:\n Calories - 2400\n Protein \u2013 200g\n Carbohydrate \u2013 250g\n Fats \u2013 65g\n\nOn Non-Training Days:\nCalories \u2013 2100\nProtein \u2013 200g\nCarbohydrate \u2013 175g\nFats \u2013 65g",
