      {
        "text": "-        Whole food multivitamin & mineral\n-      Whey isolate - have on hand in order to never miss your protein goal\n-      Creatine Monohydrate - 5g daily\n\n-      Vit D3&K2 - 1 serving daily with a meal\n\n-      Omega 3 - 2 softgels daily with meals\n\n-       Magnesium glycinate - 200mg daily taken before bed\n\n-       You can continue to take the zinc, and ashwagandha (in the afternoon or evenings, not AM) as well.\n\n-      Intra workout: Your preferred EAAs (optional) mixed with 500mg sodium + daily serving of creatine + 30oz water mixed together and sipped throughout your workout.",
